,"citedRange":128,"ptr":132,"ref":134,"inscriptionDate":127,"year":111},"corpus","IGDS1","Dubois","1989",{"ref":129},{"_":130,"target":131},"133","http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1",{"target":133},"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/RWXNUFEX",{"_":135,"target":135},"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187",{"type":137,"bibl":138},"discussion",[18],{"editor":140,"principal":143,"contributors":146,"change":157},{"_":141,"ref":142},"Jonathan Prag","#JP",{"_":144,"ref":145},"Valentina Mignosa","#VM",[147,150,154],{"_":141,"xml:id":148,"ref":149},"JP","http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537",{"_":151,"xml:id":152,"ref":153},"Simona Stoyanova","SS","https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3914-9569",{"_":144,"xml:id":155,"ref":156},"VM","http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703",{"_":158,"when":159,"who":145},"Creation of file, edition and EpiDoc encoding","2026-07-30",[],[162,163,164],"undefined, 1990","Adornato, 2008, Delphic Enigmas? The Γέλας ἀνάσσων, Polyzalos, and the Charioteer Statue","Dubois, 1989, IGDS1",[166,167,168],"F2GG87EQ","SSEFJXD3","RWXNUFEX",[170,171,172,20,25,29,173,173,174,173,175,176,97],"isic004437","votive dedication of the ruler of gela, reinscribed by polyzalos",{"_":5},"delphi","phocis","archaeological museum of delphi","ancient greek",[],{"title":179,"body":180,"divs":181,"editions":197,"images":207,"handnote":208},"ISic004437. Votive dedication of the ruler of Gela, reinscribed by Polyzalos","\u003Cdiv id=\"editions\">\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] Γέλας ἀνέ[θ]ε̄κε [ϝ]ανάσσ[ο̄ν]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[Π]ολύζαλός\u003C/span> μ’ ἀνέθηκ[ε]/ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span> τ]ὸν ἄεξ’ εὐο̄́νυμ’ Ἄπολλ̣[ον] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΓΕΛΑΣΑΝΕ[.]Ε̄ΚΕ[.]ΑΝΑΣΣ[...]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[.]ΟΛΥΖΑΛΟΣ\u003C/span>ΜΑΝΕΘΗΚ[.]/\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>.]ΟΝΑΕΞΕΥΟ̄ΝΥΜΑΠΟΛ.[..]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text: Adornato 2008, 33, fig. 3, after Keramopoullos 1909. The text erased on line 1 and the later text cut over it are encoded together; line 2 belongs to both versions.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Earlier version: “[...] he, being ruler of Gela, dedicated. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.”\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Later version: “Polyzalos dedicated me. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.” (Adornato)\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The first line originally named a \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Γέλας ἀνάσσων\u003C/span> (“ruler of Gela”) as dedicant. It was subsequently erased and overwritten with the name of Polyzalos, while the second line was left unchanged. Adornato considers the identification of the first dedicant with Polyzalos highly improbable and regards Hieron, ruler of Gela from 485 to 478 BCE, as the likelier candidate, although Gelon cannot be excluded on palaeographic grounds alone.\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Adornato dates the first inscription to a period slightly later than Gelon's Delphic tripod base and the recutting by Polyzalos before 466/5 BCE, possibly soon after Hieron's death. He argues that base 3517 and the bronze Charioteer did not belong to the same votive monument.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">133\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1990 40.0427 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Adornato 2008 29-55, especially 32-37 and 50-53 \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\" target=\"_blank\">  \u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\" target=\"_blank\">  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/a>\u003C/div>\u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\" target=\"_blank\">  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Lines 1-2 (original inscription) \u003Cp>Geloan-Agrigentine western alphabet, with semilunate gamma, four-stroke epsilon and eastern-style xi.\u003C/p>  Line 1 (reinscription by Polyzalos) \u003Cp>Later lettering, with eta, three-stroke epsilon, upsilon with a lower vertical stroke, regularised nu and broad mu.\u003C/p> \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>\u003C/a>",[182,185,188,191,194],{"id":183,"html":184},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] Γέλας ἀνέ[θ]ε̄κε [ϝ]ανάσσ[ο̄ν]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[Π]ολύζαλός\u003C/span> μ’ ἀνέθηκ[ε]/ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span> τ]ὸν ἄεξ’ εὐο̄́νυμ’ Ἄπολλ̣[ον] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΓΕΛΑΣΑΝΕ[.]Ε̄ΚΕ[.]ΑΝΑΣΣ[...]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[.]ΟΛΥΖΑΛΟΣ\u003C/span>ΜΑΝΕΘΗΚ[.]/\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>.]ΟΝΑΕΞΕΥΟ̄ΝΥΜΑΠΟΛ.[..]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>\u003C/div>",{"id":186,"html":187},"apparatus","\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text: Adornato 2008, 33, fig. 3, after Keramopoullos 1909. The text erased on line 1 and the later text cut over it are encoded together; line 2 belongs to both versions.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"id":189,"html":190},"translation","\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Earlier version: “[...] he, being ruler of Gela, dedicated. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.”\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Later version: “Polyzalos dedicated me. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.” (Adornato)\u003C/p>  ",{"id":192,"html":193},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The first line originally named a \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Γέλας ἀνάσσων\u003C/span> (“ruler of Gela”) as dedicant. It was subsequently erased and overwritten with the name of Polyzalos, while the second line was left unchanged. Adornato considers the identification of the first dedicant with Polyzalos highly improbable and regards Hieron, ruler of Gela from 485 to 478 BCE, as the likelier candidate, although Gelon cannot be excluded on palaeographic grounds alone.\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>Adornato dates the first inscription to a period slightly later than Gelon's Delphic tripod base and the recutting by Polyzalos before 466/5 BCE, possibly soon after Hieron's death. He argues that base 3517 and the bronze Charioteer did not belong to the same votive monument.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":195,"html":196},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Dubois 1989 \u003Ca href=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\" target=\"_blank\">133\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 1990 40.0427 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Adornato 2008 29-55, especially 32-37 and 50-53 \u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\" target=\"_blank\">  \u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Ca href=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\" target=\"_blank\">  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/a>",[198,200,203,204],{"html":199},"Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa",{"id":201,"lang":97,"html":202},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] Γέλας ἀνέ[θ]ε̄κε [ϝ]ανάσσ[ο̄ν]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[Π]ολύζαλός\u003C/span> μ’ ἀνέθηκ[ε]/ \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span> τ]ὸν ἄεξ’ εὐο̄́νυμ’ Ἄπολλ̣[ον] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>",{"html":199},{"id":205,"lang":97,"html":206},"edition-diplomatic","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[[[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΓΕΛΑΣΑΝΕ[.]Ε̄ΚΕ[.]ΑΝΑΣΣ[...]]]\\\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πολύζαλός\">[.]ΟΛΥΖΑΛΟΣ\u003C/span>ΜΑΝΕΘΗΚ[.]/\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>.]ΟΝΑΕΞΕΥΟ̄ΝΥΜΑΠΟΛ.[..]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 del Γέλας ἀνέθε̄κε ϝανάσσο̄ν\u003C/p>",[],[209],{"html":210},"Geloan-Agrigentine western alphabet, with semilunate gamma, four-stroke epsilon and eastern-style xi.","\u003C?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n\u003C?xml-model href=\"https://epidoc.stoa.org/schema/latest/tei-epidoc.rng\" type=\"application/xml\" schematypens=\"http://relaxng.org/ns/structure/1.0\"?>\n\u003C?xml-model href=\"../schematron/ircyr-checking.sch\" schematypens=\"http://purl.oclc.org/dsdl/schematron\"?>\n\u003CTEI xmlns=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" xml:lang=\"en\" xmlns:xi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude\">\n    \u003CteiHeader>\n        \u003CfileDesc>\n            \u003CtitleStmt>\n                \u003Ctitle>Votive dedication of the ruler of Gela, reinscribed by Polyzalos\u003C/title>\n                \u003Ceditor ref=\"#JP\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/editor>\n                \u003Cprincipal ref=\"#VM\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/principal>\n                \u003Cfunder>John Fell OUP Research Fund\u003C/funder>\n                \u003Cfunder>\u003Cref target=\"https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/885040\">ERC Advanced Grant no.885040\u003C/ref>\u003C/funder>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"JP\" ref=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>Project direction, template development, general editing\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n              \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"SS\" ref=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3914-9569\">Simona Stoyanova\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>Standardisation of template and tidying up encoding\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n                \u003CrespStmt>\n                    \u003Cname xml:id=\"VM\" ref=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Valentina Mignosa\u003C/name>\n                    \u003Cresp>File creation, edition and EpiDoc encoding\u003C/resp>\n                \u003C/respStmt>\n            \u003C/titleStmt>\n            \u003CpublicationStmt>\n                \u003Cauthority>I.Sicily\u003C/authority>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"filename\">ISic004437\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"TM\">696177\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDR\"/>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDH\"/>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"EDCS\"/>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"PHI\"/>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"URI\">http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic004437\u003C/idno>\n                \u003Cidno type=\"DOI\"/>\n                \u003Cavailability>\n                    \u003Clicence target=\"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\">Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.\u003C/licence>\n                \u003C/availability>\n            \u003C/publicationStmt>\n            \u003CsourceDesc>\n                \u003CmsDesc>\n                    \u003CmsIdentifier>\n                        \u003Ccountry>Greece\u003C/country>\n                        \u003Cregion>Phocis\u003C/region>\n                        \u003Csettlement>Delphi\u003C/settlement>\n                        \u003Crepository role=\"museum\">Archaeological Museum of Delphi\u003C/repository>\n                        \u003Cidno type=\"inventory\">3517\u003C/idno>\n                        \u003CaltIdentifier>\n                            \u003Csettlement/>\n                            \u003Crepository/>\n                            \u003Cidno type=\"old\"/>\n                        \u003C/altIdentifier>\n                    \u003C/msIdentifier>\n                    \u003CmsContents>\n                        \u003CtextLang mainLang=\"grc\">Ancient Greek\u003C/textLang>\n                    \u003C/msContents>\n                    \u003CphysDesc>\n                        \u003CobjectDesc>\n                            \u003CsupportDesc>\n                                \u003Csupport>\n                                    \u003Cp>Grey-beige limestone base from the Parnassos quarry. The upper surface has three attachment holes, approximately 6.5, 6.1 and 5.6 cm wide, corresponding to the position of animals' hooves.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Cmaterial ana=\"#material.stone.limestone\" subtype=\"unverified\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/66.html\">limestone\u003C/material>\n                                    \u003CobjectType ana=\"#object.base\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/57.html\">base\u003C/objectType>\n                                    \u003Cdimensions>\n                                        \u003Cheight unit=\"cm\">29.8\u003C/height>\n                                        \u003Cwidth unit=\"cm\">83.6 (front); 91.5 (back)\u003C/width>\n                                        \u003Cdepth unit=\"cm\">80.8 (left); 80.2 (right)\u003C/depth>\n                                    \u003C/dimensions>\n                                \u003C/support>\n                                \u003Ccondition ana=\"#condition.damaged\"/>\n                            \u003C/supportDesc>\n                            \u003ClayoutDesc>\n                                \u003Clayout>\n                                    \u003Cp>The metrical inscription is chiselled on the front face in two lines. The first line was erased and reinscribed; the second line was retained.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Crs ana=\"#execution.chiselled\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1\">chiselled\u003C/rs>\n                                    \u003Cdamage ana=\"#text_condition.incomplete\"/>\n                                \u003C/layout>\n                            \u003C/layoutDesc>\n                        \u003C/objectDesc>\n                        \u003ChandDesc>\n                            \u003ChandNote xml:id=\"h1\">\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line2\">Lines 1-2 (original inscription)\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cp>Geloan-Agrigentine western alphabet, with semilunate gamma, four-stroke epsilon and eastern-style xi.\u003C/p>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                            \u003ChandNote xml:id=\"h2\">\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1 (reinscription by Polyzalos)\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cp>Later lettering, with eta, three-stroke epsilon, upsilon with a lower vertical stroke, regularised nu and broad mu.\u003C/p>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                        \u003C/handDesc>\n                    \u003C/physDesc>\n                    \u003Chistory>\n                        \u003Corigin>\n                            \u003CorigPlace>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"ancient\" ref=\"https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/540726\">Delphi\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"modern\" ref=\"https://sws.geonames.org/263219/\">Delphi\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003Cgeo>38.482289, 22.501169\u003C/geo>\n                            \u003C/origPlace>\n                            \u003CorigDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" notBefore-custom=\"-0485\" notAfter-custom=\"-0465\">ca. 485-466/5 BCE, in two phases\u003C/origDate>\n                        \u003C/origin>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"found\" subtype=\"discovered\" when=\"1896-04-16\">Found in the Sanctuary of Apollo at Delphi, in the area of the Ischegaon, during the Grande Fouille\u003Cgeo>38.482408,22.5004633\u003C/geo>.\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"observed\" subtype=\"autopsied\">Not autopsied by the editor\u003C/provenance>\n                    \u003C/history>\n                \u003C/msDesc>\n            \u003C/sourceDesc>\n        \u003C/fileDesc>\n        \u003CencodingDesc>\n            \u003Cp>Encoded following the latest EpiDoc guidelines\u003C/p>\n            \u003Cxi:include href=\"../alists/ISicily-taxonomies.xml\">\n                \u003Cxi:fallback>\n                    \u003Cp>Taxonomies for ISicily controlled values\u003C/p>\n                \u003C/xi:fallback>\n            \u003C/xi:include>\n            \u003Cxi:include href=\"../alists/charDecl.xml\">\n                \u003Cxi:fallback>\n                    \u003Cp>ISicily glyphs authority list\u003C/p>\n                \u003C/xi:fallback>\n            \u003C/xi:include>\n        \u003C/encodingDesc>\n        \u003CprofileDesc>\n            \u003CcalendarDesc>\n                \u003Ccalendar xml:id=\"julian\">\n                    \u003Cp>Julian Calendar\u003C/p>\n                \u003C/calendar>\n            \u003C/calendarDesc>\n            \u003ClangUsage>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"en\">English\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"it\">Italian\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"grc\">Ancient Greek\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"la\">Latin\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"he\">Hebrew\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"phn\">Phoenician\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"xpu\">Punic\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"osc\">Oscan\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"xly\">Elymian\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"scx\">Sikel\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"sxc\">Sikan\u003C/language>\n            \u003C/langUsage>\n            \u003CtextClass>\n                \u003Ckeywords scheme=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/typeins.html\">\n                    \u003Cterm ana=\"#function.dedication.votive\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/typeins/lod/83.html\">votive\u003C/term>\n                \u003C/keywords>\n            \u003C/textClass>\n        \u003C/profileDesc>\n        \u003CrevisionDesc status=\"draft\">\n            \u003ClistChange>\n                \u003Cchange when=\"2026-07-30\" who=\"#VM\">Creation of file, edition and EpiDoc encoding\u003C/change>\n            \u003C/listChange>\n        \u003C/revisionDesc>\n    \u003C/teiHeader>\n    \u003Cfacsimile>\u003Csurface/>\u003C!--\n        \u003Csurface type=\"front\">\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"screen\" url=\"ISic004437_tiled.tif\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"print\" url=\"ISic004437.jpg\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n         \u003C/surface>\n     -->\u003C/facsimile>\n    \u003Ctext>\n        \u003Cbody>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"grc\" resp=\"#VM\">\n                \u003Cab>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Csubst>\u003Cdel rend=\"erasure\" hand=\"#h1\">\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/> Γέλας ἀνέ\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">θ\u003C/supplied>ε̄κε \u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">ϝ\u003C/supplied>ανάσσ\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">ο̄ν\u003C/supplied>\u003C/del>\u003Cadd place=\"overstrike\" hand=\"#h2\">\u003Cname>\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">Π\u003C/supplied>ολύζαλός\u003C/name> μ’ ἀνέθηκ\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">ε\u003C/supplied>\u003C/add>\u003C/subst>\n                    \u003Clb n=\"2\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/> \u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">τ\u003C/supplied>ὸν ἄεξ’ εὐο̄́νυμ’ Ἄπολ\u003Cunclear>λ\u003C/unclear>\u003Csupplied reason=\"lost\">ον\u003C/supplied>\n                \u003C/ab>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\n                    \u003Capp>\n                        \u003Cnote>Text: Adornato 2008, 33, fig. 3, after Keramopoullos 1909. The text erased on line 1 and the later text cut over it are encoded together; line 2 belongs to both versions.\u003C/note>\n                    \u003C/app>\n                \u003C/listApp>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\" xml:lang=\"en\" resp=\"#VM\">\n                \u003Cp>Earlier version: “[...] he, being ruler of Gela, dedicated. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.”\u003C/p>\n                \u003Cp>Later version: “Polyzalos dedicated me. [...] Give him glory, noble Apollo.” (Adornato)\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"commentary\">\n                \u003Cp>The first line originally named a \u003Cforeign xml:lang=\"grc\">Γέλας ἀνάσσων\u003C/foreign> (“ruler of Gela”) as dedicant. It was subsequently erased and overwritten with the name of Polyzalos, while the second line was left unchanged. Adornato considers the identification of the first dedicant with Polyzalos highly improbable and regards Hieron, ruler of Gela from 485 to 478 BCE, as the likelier candidate, although Gelon cannot be excluded on palaeographic grounds alone.\u003C/p>\n                \u003Cp>Adornato dates the first inscription to a period slightly later than Gelon's Delphic tripod base and the recutting by Polyzalos before 466/5 BCE, possibly soon after Hieron's death. He argues that base 3517 and the bronze Charioteer did not belong to the same votive monument.\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"bibliography\">\u003C!-- Syll.³ 35 D; LSAG 275 no. 6; F.Delphes III 4 452; IV 5 pp. 26-31; CEG 397; -->\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"edition\">\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"SEG\">\n                        \u003Cdate>1990\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>40.0427\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/F2GG87EQ\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl>\n                        \u003Cauthor>Adornato\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>2008\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>29-55, especially 32-37 and 50-53\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"http://zotero.org/groups/382445/items/SSEFJXD3\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://doi.org/10.3764/aja.112.1.29\"/>\n                    \u003C/bibl>\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"corpus\" n=\"IGDS1\">\n                        \u003Cauthor>Dubois\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Cdate>1989\u003C/date> \n                        \u003CcitedRange>\n                            \u003Cref target=\"http://www.persee.fr/doc/efr_0000-0000_1989_cat_119_1\">133\u003C/ref>\n                        \u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/RWXNUFEX\"/>\n                        \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000187\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"discussion\">\n                    \u003Cbibl/>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n            \u003C/div>\n        \u003C/body>\n    \u003C/text>\n\u003C/TEI>"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
